<%# The donation receipt's letter. Short on purpose: the case for giving to a
    particular theater cannot be written generically, and a vague version of it
    is worse than none. A house that wants to make that case -- attendance
    figures, what contributed income actually pays for -- overrides this whole
    template in its theme; see sites/example/README.md.

    The subject line is the one piece of house copy that is not a view; it is an
    I18n key so a theme can carry it (see config/locales/en.yml). %>
<% content_for :email_title do %>
 Thanks for your support!
<% end %>
<p>
  Thank you for your contribution of <%= number_to_currency(@order.total_paid) %>.
  Gifts like yours pay for the work on our stages — they are not a nicety, they are
  how the season happens.
</p>
<p>
  <%= render 'shared/house_thanks_line' %>
</p>
<p>
  Best,<br/><br/>
  <%= render 'signature' %>
</p>
